    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to survive 3 minutes and 40 seconds to beat the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a continuously accelerating spaceship through a neon obstacle course to the beat of an electrifying synthwave soundtrack. Your only controls are left and right. Crashing in an obstacle is an instant game over, so collect ammo on your way to clear your path, but remember, unused ammo boosts your final score. Save your score online and compete for the top spot on the global leaderboard with your best runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls (qwerty):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move left and right : [arrows keys] or [A and D].</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firing lasers to shoot obstacles : [up arrow] or [W] or [space].</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to survive 3 minutes and 40 seconds to beat the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a continuously accelerating spaceship through a neon obstacle course to the beat of an electrifying synthwave soundtrack. Your only controls are left and right. Crashing in an obstacle is an instant game over, so collect ammo on your way to clear your path, but remember, unused ammo boosts your final score. Save your score online and compete for the top spot on the global leaderboard with your best runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls (qwerty):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move left and right : [arrows keys] or [A and D].</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firing lasers to shoot obstacles : [up arrow] or [W] or [space].</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
